lang and hope thundine  whether and how their suits will be  modified in the third part we do not  know so far neither are there any  changes to hope's parents dr henry hank  pym and jen van dyne are also part of  the team and will be again played by  michael douglas and michelle pfeiffer  the first new cast member is scott's  daughter cassie this character will now  already be played by a third actress in  parts one and two the young cassie was  portrayed by abby ryder fortune in end  game she got the first recast where  she's embodied by emma fuhrman this is  mainly due to the fact that she survived  the snap and thus aged by 5 years  however it is now clear that a new  actress has been hired for quantomania  2. this time it is catherine newton who  will play the role of ant-man's daughter  what is controversial here is that  furman was not even informed about the  recasting in advance  he was first introduced in the series  loki though not really as a villain  nevertheless fans know that he's a  manifest character the talk here is  about kang the conqueror whose real name  is nathaniel richards in the marvel  universe he's related to reed richards  aka mr fantastic the head of the  fantastic four and at least in some  universes the smartest person on earth  so this could be another step in slowly  but surely incorporating the fantastic  four into the mcu kang is played here as  in loki by jonathan magers  already in the first ant-man film main  character scott lang met the villain  darren cross also known as yellowjacket  in the end ant-man was finally able to  defeat his opponent by manipulating his  suit and thus seemingly crushing him in  the past the theory that cross could  have survived the entire event came up  more often not least because director  peyton reid himself spoke of cross  possibility just being trapped in the  quantum realm that's not a definite  announcement yet of course but combined  with an image released by evangeline  lilly things are slowly but surely  starting to take on a clear shape the  wasp actress put the name of  yellowjacket actor corey stuller  hashtags and deleted the picture again  shortly after which is a pretty clear  sign as we think  another celebrity joining the movie is  bill murray murray is probably one of  the most popular actors in hollywood it  is not known yet which part he will play  and the actor himself was not allowed to  reveal anything up to now when asked by  a reporter what his superpowers are he  replied my superpower is that i'm a bad  guy ant-man could therefore have to deal  with the multitude of antagonists rumor  has it that murray could take on the  role of crylar appropriately enough he's  up to mischief on the quantum realm  it was clear fairly quickly that a third  ant-man film would be made the first two  parts together grossed more than one  billion us dollars peyton reed was soon  brought in again as director having  already taken the reigns in the first  two movies jeff loveness who has already  written episodes for rick and morty was  selected as the screenwriter the new  film seems to have a lot of humor to  offer two years after the sequel was  confirmed filming began at pinewood  studios in nearby london as with the  mandalorian the movie will be shot using  stagecraft technology this involves  previously created backgrounds being  projected onto large led video walls on  the film set at the end of november 2021  filming of the last scene was completed  which was much faster than anticipated  in fact filming was not expected to end  until the beginning of 2022 at the  earliest which is why the movie release  has now been rescheduled ahead of time  to february 2023  unfortunately nothing is known about the  plot at this point so we can only  speculate as to how this story might  continue the main question here is how  kang could make an appearance does he  come from the future the past or is it  even the version of kang that lives on  earth at this time it would also be  feasible that he comes to earth through  the quantum realm or maybe he needs the  perhaps unintended help of cryler and  jello jacket to what degree kang is  aware of himself or his other versions  also remains to be seen maybe he's not  introduced as a villain at all but is  still or even permanently on the good  side as nathaniel richards this would be  especially conceivable if you want to  bring up kang as the next big enemy of  the new avengers it also seems to be  coming into fashion in the mcu right now  to turn former heroes into villains in  any case he seems a bit too powerful as  the sole antagonist for ant-man another  storyline we are looking forward to is  that of cassie lang for us the recasting  can mean two things first that scott's  time in the ant-man suit is slowly but  surely coming to an end and that his  daughter will take over as superhero  stature at least she would fit in well  with the rest of the young avengers in  the comics she lives with her father at  the avengers headquarters where without  the knowledge of the other members she  secretly injects herself with pym  particles by doing so she alters her  genes and develops superpowers like her  father she can't shrink or grow taller  but without the suit however as we said  at the beginning there are only  assumptions about what direction the  plot might take anyway it should not  take much longer until the first trailer  will be released then we will surely  know more about scott hope and cassie  that was our preview of ant-man and the  wasp quantomania even though not much is  known so far we were hopefully still  able to give you a good overview what do  you think the plot might look like let  us know in the comments and if you  enjoyed the video don't forget to give  it a thumbs up see you next time  [Music]  you

